# Model weights, not source.
#
# This directory holds 410 MB of encoder artifacts that were untracked but not
# ignored, which is one `git add .` away from entering the repository. The plan
# and the README both described them as gitignored; they were not. This file
# makes that true.
#
# It lives here rather than in the root .gitignore so that it travels with the
# directory if it is lifted into a separate project.
#
# Everything below is regenerated by the scripts in this directory:
#   output_models/          <- export_distilled_onnx.py, build_*.py
#   *_l3/ and *_l6/         <- the Colab distillation and contrastive stages
#
# Reports and metadata are NOT ignored. holdout_results.md, pooling.json and
# the contract itself are the record of what was measured, and a run that
# leaves nothing behind did not happen.

# Exported ONNX artifacts, quantised weights, classifier heads
output_models/

# sentence-transformers output directories (model.safetensors, 68-90 MB each).
# Named by depth: any future student directory should follow the same suffix
# so it is covered here without anyone having to remember to add it.
*_l3/
*_l6/
*_l12/

# Archives produced by shutil.make_archive at the end of the Colab stages
*.zip

# Scratch directories created mid-export and normally removed
temp_tokenizer/
temp_pt/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
